---
import BrutalLayout from '../layouts/BrutalLayout.astro';

const lang = 'en';
---

<BrutalLayout
  title="Dont's Panic, V!"
  description="Curriculum vitae"
  lang={lang}
  langSwitchHref="/cs/cv"
>
	  <div class="space-y-12">
	    <header class="space-y-3">
	      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
	        I want to understand systems end to end — how CPUs execute instructions, how operating systems, programming languages, databases, containers, proxies, and protocols all fit together. Some of that I picked up out of curiosity, the rest by debugging production. Almost ten years of building and operating Meiro taught me the domains: customer data infrastructure, identity resolution, real-time pipelines, and the edge cases that come with running a CDP for enterprise customers. What I enjoy most is picking up new technology, understanding how it actually works, and figuring out how to apply it. Right now that means AI — running Qwen locally, building agentic workflows with Claude, designing self-learning data analysis tools. I bring these to production, not just demos. I'm also the person who ends up explaining everything — to engineers, to customers, on stage when the occasion calls for it. Teaching is how I verify I actually understand something. On the commercial side, I've navigated enough RFPs and B2B sales cycles to speak the language of enterprise buyers.
	      </p>
	      <p class="text-muted leading-relaxed">
	        Co-founder and Head of R&amp;D at Meiro (Customer Data Platform). Previously: Solutions Architect and Head Nerd at Keboola (Datadriven Co. Pte Ltd).
	      </p>
	    </header>

    <section class="space-y-6">
      <h3 class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-muted">Experience</h3>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-medium">Meiro</h4>
            <span class="text-sm text-muted">Brno, Czechia</span>
          </div>
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted">
            <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <span class="text-text font-medium">Head of R&amp;D &amp; Co-Founder</span>
              <span>Mar 2024 – Present</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
              <span class="text-text font-medium">CTO &amp; Co-Founder</span>
              <span>Sep 2018 – May 2024</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted">
            <li>Owned product architecture, development, and implementations of the Meiro CDP.</li>
            <li>Hands-on with delivery and the real-world data integration edge cases that come with it.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-2">
          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
            <h4 class="text-lg font-medium">Keboola (Datadriven Co. Pte Ltd)</h4>
          </div>
	          <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm text-muted">
	            <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
	              <span class="text-text font-medium">Head Nerd</span>
	              <span>Aug 2015 – Sep 2018</span>
	            </li>
	            <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-1">
	              <span class="text-text font-medium">Solutions Architect</span>
	              <span>Aug 2015 – Jul 2018 (Bali, Indonesia)</span>
	            </li>
	          </ul>
          <ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-sm text-muted">
            <li>Designed solutions to customer needs and helped teams ship data integrations end-to-end.</li>
            <li>Worked on data transport and transformation challenges, including the messy edge cases.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

	  </div>
</BrutalLayout>
